## P4: documentation debt

### 21. Rewrite README.md and PRD.md against the code
Both currently document the OSC control table, hardware decode, working saturation,
Pioneer pdb output, and v0.4 exports as fixed. None of that is true.

Rule going forward: a feature is documented as working only after a test asserts it.
The pattern in this repo has been docs written from intent, then reused as evidence
in the next review. `docs/STATUS.md` uses explicit status values to make that harder.
Est: 2 hours.

### 22. Add `--developer` smoke checklist to docs
The Developer Tools CO browser is currently the only way to exercise the video and
export controls, since OSC does not exist. Write it down so it is not rediscovered
every session.
Est: 30 min.
